    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c826d0fc44bb58b749056f01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而北部玄驹，\n相信自己并积极努力着。\n面对与自己的差异，她曾暗自抱有自卑感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84270dceb50bbaed7a7fb8d7683d07178953a5b07bd1d25cace2c6a050fdd0d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be7a536ecc693fdaf4883c43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『日本德比』后，得知了那样的她\n也有抱有自卑感的对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8787bf2a536da9a90ac85d5d099e21807a08bb0a59449f6d8954fd47ee87391f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60282ea06acd65b5f71ace98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后今天……甚至将自卑感化作动力变强，\n坦率地接受观众声援的\n北部玄驹就在那里——",
      "source_fingerprint": "994e2c69a5a94d2938b9191843a390f2c4dcbe983e4ebc950ca9758dbb79c358",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
